        <mxCell id="text_45" value="&lt;div&gt;† P2-S02: user_account.created_at is required by §5.3 but is absent from the C0 table and class implementation.&lt;br/&gt;† P2-S03: TOURIST CHECK requires passport_no and email; nationality IS NOT NULL is absent at C0.&lt;br/&gt;† P2-S07: customer.user_id is FK + UNIQUE, but SQL does not require the linked user_account.role = CUSTOMER.&lt;br/&gt;Customer is one table with customer_type LOCAL / TOURIST; no subtype tables. Kitchen staff role iff hub_id is set.&lt;br/&gt;† design target, not yet in code at C0 (see P4 inputs P2-S02/S03/S07).&lt;br/&gt;Continuation: Catalogue/listing continues in PartB; orders in PartC; payment/delivery in PartD; offers in PartE.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=26;fontColor=#202B36;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="82" y="972" width="1347.265625" height="195.0" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
